    "The tracer is solved steady beside the flow, as three species of one flow. The outlet carried 0.86, 0.73 and 0.70 of the emission for Sct 0.3, 0.5 and 0.7, the fixture's bar being a factor of two, a detector of wiring errors and not a convergence claim. The largest modelled c* over the 344 points is in the source street for every species, at y = -0.12 m (Sct 0.3) and y = +0.18 m (Sct 0.5 and 0.7), against the tunnel's 1.929 at (-0.15, -0.12, 0.004).",
